"<div id=\"main\"><section class=\"wrap outcome-hero split\" data-hero><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><a class=\"link text-sm\" href=\"/#solutions\">← Explore solutions</a><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Import existing records</p><h1 class=\"display outcome-title\">Bring your records<br><span class=\"text-blue\">into Certifyd.</span></h1><p class=\"copy\">Start with your worker spreadsheet. Bring people into the system, connect them to role requirements and agree how to carry the supporting evidence across.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2\"><a class=\"cta\" href=\"#demo\">Plan your import <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"link\" href=\"#prepare\">See how it works ↓</a></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate\">For teams moving from spreadsheets and shared folders.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Bring the starting point with you</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"import-map\"><div class=\"sheet\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-slate\">Your worker spreadsheet</p><div class=\"record-row\"><span class=\"text-sm\">Name</span><strong class=\"text-sm\">Jamie Taylor</strong></div><div class=\"record-row\"><span class=\"text-sm\">Job title</span><strong class=\"text-sm\">Care assistant</strong></div><div class=\"record-row\"><span class=\"text-sm\">Email</span><span class=\"text-sm\">jamie@example.com</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 py-4 text-blue\"><span class=\"font-mono text-3xl\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Match the fields. Check the details.</p></div><div class=\"sheet border-l-4 border-l-blue\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Your company workspace</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-xl font-semibold\">Jamie Taylor</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate\">Care assistant · Role requirements to review</p></div></div></div></figure></section><nav aria-label=\"On this page\" class=\"sticky top-0 z-30 border-y border-line bg-white\"><div class=\"wrap outcome-nav\"><a href=\"#prepare\" data-chapter-link=\"prepare\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">01</span>Prepare the source</a><a href=\"#map\" data-chapter-link=\"map\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">02</span>Match the roles</a><a href=\"#launch\" data-chapter-link=\"launch\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">03</span>Plan the rollout</a></div></nav><div class=\"wrap\"><section id=\"prepare\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">01 / Prepare the source</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Start with the records<br>you already have.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Gather your worker spreadsheet and identify the roles it covers. Note where the supporting documents live so you can plan the evidence work alongside the worker import.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">The starting point is a CSV or spreadsheet of worker details. The document migration plan depends on your source material.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Make the first import manageable</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Prepare the source</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold\">Worker list.csv</h3><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Worker details</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Check names and contact details</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Check</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Role names</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Agree the roles your team uses</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Map</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Existing evidence</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">List where supporting files are held</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Plan</span></div><p class=\"mt-5 text-sm text-slate\">Start with one worker list and one role. Agree how the supporting documents will be brought across.</p></div></div></figure></section><section id=\"map\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">02 / Connect the requirements</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Match workers to roles.<br>Set the evidence needed.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Use your existing job titles to agree the right roles in Certifyd. Each role gives your team a clear set of requirements to check as records come across.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">Bringing a worker into the system does not verify their evidence. Your team still reviews the records.</p><button data-open-screen class=\"link\">View role setup ↗</button></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The right starting point</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-5 text-blue\">Start with the role</p><h3 class=\"mb-1 text-2xl font-semibold\">Care assistant</h3><p class=\"mb-5 text-sm text-slate\">Your requirements shape the record.</p><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Workplace induction</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Set by your organisation</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Required</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Manual handling</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Evidence and expiry date</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Required</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Identity document</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Review by your team</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Required</span></div><div class=\"mt-6 border-l-2 border-blue pl-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Jamie’s next step</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate\">Add the requested evidence.</p></div></div></div></figure></section><section id=\"launch\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">03 / Review before rollout</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Check the first group.<br>Then bring the team in.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Review a small group with the people who manage your records. Check worker details, role assignments and outstanding evidence before planning the wider rollout.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Plan a controlled start</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><ol class=\"sheet flex flex-col gap-7\"><li class=\"point\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">01</p><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Agree the first group</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Choose one role and the worker list you want to start with.</p></li><li class=\"point\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">02</p><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Review the records together</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Check the imported details and identify missing evidence.</p></li><li class=\"point\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">03</p><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Plan the wider rollout</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Agree who will review records and invite the remaining workers.</p></li></ol></div></figure></section><section class=\"split py-12 md:py-16\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Keep the work connected</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Keep records useful after the move.</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-3\"><p class=\"copy\">Put dates and review activity alongside the evidence, so the next renewal has a clear starting point.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"/platform/records/\">Explore tracked records <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"link text-sm\" href=\"/\">Explore the full Certifyd story →</a></div></section></div><section id=\"demo\" class=\"bg-ink py-16 text-white md:py-20\"><div class=\"wrap split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-[#93BBFF]\">Bring your workflow</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Bring a spreadsheet.<br>Plan the first step.</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-6\"><p class=\"max-w-[43ch] text-lg text-white/80\">Talk us through your worker list, roles and document storage. We’ll map out a practical starting point for your team.</p><a class=\"cta bg-white text-ink hover:bg-sky\" href=\"https://cal.com/andrew-speer/certifyd-discovery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book an import conversation <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><p class=\"text-sm text-white/75\">A 20-minute conversation with the Certifyd team.</p></div></div></section></div><dialog id=\"screen-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"screen-title\" class=\"m-auto max-h-[94dvh] w-[min(96vw,90rem)] overflow-auto rounded-sm border border-line bg-white p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-5\"><h2 id=\"screen-title\" class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Set the requirements for each role</h2><button autofocus data-close class=\"cta\">Close</button></div><img src=\"/images/connected/roles.png\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1144\" alt=\"Certifyd role selection screen showing Nurse selected\" class=\"h-auto w-full\"></dialog>"
